==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|junk-yard|junk yard}}

===Etymology===
From {{affix|en|junk|yard}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A place where [[rubbish]] is discarded.
# A [[business]] that sells used metal or items.

